  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have Power $=$ Rate of doing work $=\\frac{d W}{d t}$\r\nor, $\\quad P=\\frac{d W}{d t}=$ rate of change in $\\mathrm{KE}$\r\ni.e., $\\quad P=\\frac{d W}{d t}=\\frac{d(\\mathrm{KE})}{d t}=$ constant",
